+- Any rejection inside the turn calls `onError` with an `Error` — passed through as the same instance when the thrown value is already an `Error`, or wrapped with a readable `message` and the original value as `cause` otherwise — and then runs `afterSession` while still propagating the original rejection to the caller ([validated by: calls onError with an Error carrying the thrown string and runs afterSession while rethrowing](../../src/orchestration/onErrorNonError.acceptance.test.ts#L53), [validated by: calls onError with an Error carrying a readable message when the stream rejects with a plain object](../../src/orchestration/onErrorNonError.acceptance.test.ts#L64), [validated by: wraps non-Error rejections with cause and passes Error instances through](../../src/orchestration/rejectionHook.test.ts#L42), [validated by: still calls onError with cause and rethrows the original value when String coercion itself throws](../../src/orchestration/rejectionHook.test.ts#L95)).
 
